    <item>
      <title>HELLO CLIPY 1.4.0b1 Beta</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:42:32 +0900</pubDate>
      <link>https://github.com/KDOJP/HelloClipy-Updates/releases/tag/v1.4.0b1</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Beta release with an opt-in beta update channel in Preferences.</p>
        <p>Synchronizes clipboard-history deletions safely using CloudKit tombstones and improves full-history deletion.</p>
        <p>Synchronizes snippet-folder hot keys between Macs.</p>
      ]]></description>
      <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
